Dialogue: 10,0:23:30.87,0:23:31.81,Satania,Satania,0,0,0,,Ngon~!
Dialogue: 9,0:23:30.87,0:23:31.81,Satania - BG,Satania,0,0,0,,{\blur2}Ngon~!
